.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# generated contract artefacts are committed intentionally:
# backend/openapi.json is tracked so CI can diff the contract (PRD B-4, E-16)

# Never store uploaded media in the repo — STORAGE_ROOT lives outside it.
# These MUST stay anchored with a leading slash. Unanchored, `storage/` matches a
# directory of that name at any depth, which silently excluded the whole of
# `backend/libs/storage/` — the @library/storage source — from version control.
/storage/
/uploads/
